blocks.en:
In this section,
we ask whether Agentic-TTT can achieve self-improvement through learned agency over TTT skills;
whether its inference-time compute can be controlled;
and whether the learned policy transfers beyond the training distributions.

blocks.zh:
在本节中,
我们问Agentic-TTT是否能够通过学习机构在TTT技能上实现自我改进;
其推断时间的计算能否控制;
以及学到的政策是否在培训分配之外转移。

